yers instead of silence.\",\n        \"Message me below and we'll find them.\"\n      ],\n      \"first_asks\": [],\n      \"reveal_line\": \"You said your goal is that first hundred dollars, so this one finds the people who'll buy your first shirt.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggested_agents\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"I'll find 8 high quality t-shirt warehouses near you and pick one you can order your first sample from\",\n      \"description\": \"Your designs are ready but no shirt has been made yet. I'll compare the best t-shirt warehouses around San Francisco and get your sample requests ready to send.\",\n      \"agent_prompt\": \"Goal: help the user order the first physical sample of their first anime t-shirt design. They have designs ready, have never used Shopify, and want real samples from a warehouse before launching. The user is in San Francisco. Find 8 high quality t-shirt printing warehouses and small batch screen printers in San Francisco and the Bay Area (local pickup or fast regional shipping), judged on print quality, blank quality, and reviews. Answer in the chat, no file: lead with the ONE warehouse to order the first sample from and why in two sentences, then a short table of the best options with only these columns: shop, where, why it fits (a few words), 1 sample, 20 shirts, minimum, turnaround, rating, link. Every cell a few words or a number (\\\"Quote\\\" when unknown); caveats go in a sentence below the table, never in the cells. Then the emails: if Gmail is connected (check your own tool list), write a sample and quote request email to each of the top 3 warehouses and save them as Gmail drafts, never send; say they are waiting in Gmail. If Gmail is not connected, say plainly: connect Gmail in Settings, Integrations and I'll draft a sample request email to each of the top 3 right in your inbox.\",\n      \"clicky_key\": \"demo-maker\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"I'll go through 20 anime apparel Shopify stores and tell you what types of